            ],
            "review_state": "unreviewed",
            "unsupported": false
          },
          {
            "text": "In the encoder-decoder attention layers, queries are derived from the previous decoder layer, while memory keys and values come from the encoder's output, enabling every decoder position to attend over all input positions.",
